ts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malikrajat/rm-ng-device-detection/commits/d717a8b4e3376bef2b116e4d6b2b1cdc32538e69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T02:40:04Z","email":"11173135+malikrajat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rajat"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T02:40:04Z","email":"11173135+malikrajat@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Rajat"},"message":"Release 5.0.1: modern parser, bug fixes & features\n\nBumps package to v5.0.1 and introduces a modern, dependency-free parsing engine and API enhancements. Adds standalone parseUserAgent(), DetectionOptions.basicMode, bounded parse cache, and extensibility hooks (registerCustomDevice/Browser/OS, clearCustomDetectors). Fixes critical multi-line-RegExp bug via multilineRegex(), expands device/browser/OS/version/distro coverage and bot detection, and adds viewport/screen fields + updateScreenInfo(). Adds async helpers (detectWindows11ViaClientHints, isBraveViaFeatureDetection), exposes new exports/typing updates, updates README/CHANGELOG, and updates license year.","tree":{"sha":"10f2077504232196d32aefeecbc68ed0817cecb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malikrajat/rm-ng-device-detection/git/trees/10f2077504232196d32aefeecbc68ed0817cecb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/malikrajat/rm-ng-device-detection/git/commits/d717a8b4e3376bef2b116e4d6b2b1cdc32538e69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11173135?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malikrajat/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/malikrajat","id":11173135,"login":"malikrajat","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTczMTM1","organizations_url":"htt