5657c2028fec5a7bbf8212bc0dd84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/372e9f9c9475657c2028fec5a7bbf8212bc0dd84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7634296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/futjesus","id":7634296,"login":"futjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/f406ba1826d048f8366c30455119af7905403f37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:13:55Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:13:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"✨ feat(spinner): phase-lock every spinner to one shared animation start (#748)\n\nA Spinner that replaces another one (a route fallback handing over to a lazy chunk''s fallback) restarted its rotation at 0° and replayed its entrance fade, which shows as a blink. Every Spinner now adopts the start time of the first one mounted in the document through a callback ref, so consecutive instances are at the same angle and the swap is pixel-identical.\n\nRolldown only keeps a module-level ''use client'' on entry chunks, and the root barrel imports Spinner from the shared chunk directly, so the directive never reached consumers rendering it from a React Server Component. A small Vite plugin re-stamps the directive on every chunk whose lib modules all declared it (Counter and Toast pick it up too); mixed chunks stay untouched.","tree":{"sha":"a75c322e39843cbc3e2e527aeac74711926ebb26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/a75c322e39843cbc3e2e527aeac74711926ebb26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/f406ba1826d048f8366c30455119af7905403f37","verification":{"payload":"tree a75c322e39843cbc3e2e527aeac74711926ebb26\nparent 276ec74edd91482934ac992dd014a3ea3d159a58\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1790781235 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790781235 -0300\n\n✨ feat(spinner): phase-lock every spinner to one shared animation start (#748)\n\nA Spinner that replaces another one (a route fallback handing over to a lazy chunk''s fallback) restarted its rotation at 0° and replayed its entrance fade, which shows as a blink. Every Spinner now adopts the start time of the first one mounted in the document through a callback ref, so consecutive instances are at the same angle and the swap is pixel-identical.\n\nRolldown only keeps a module-level ''use client'' on entry chunks, and the root barrel imports Spinner from the shared chunk directly, so the directive never reached consumers rendering it from a React Server Component. A small Vite plugin re-stamps the directive on every chunk whose lib modules all declared it (Counter and Toast pick it up too); mixed chunks stay untouched.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvSczCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAozoQADCfyXel31YoNmaqgmnIdBsu\nxBa8LhDh0dsCXjW9o73o+81fN/1fR2aHcUz+pOAZW6OROH8YAhnNMqjLFgOK80WN\nBrFL8D2XDlMUqG1xzGQljCs290GxvH8aXq3ucrks/KLVKJzjgIcm0+UtZeJeJnob\n7PzltA91nkmFxWADriFBYX6Df1btRz4vvC7gNejF8cfzMibJC4SuTAF9scLHepo7\n238MlKVMthSuzKJeT4gcyqS2j