_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/528cfa9c570b88af48bb4bb391f89707e2f69494/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:37:09Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:37:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"✨ feat: add AllSetCheck, Detach, Pause, SpendStatement and Updated icons (#714)\n\nBrings into the library the custom icons that lived only in the Civo\nmicro-frontends so they can be consumed from @konstructio/ui/icons:\n\n- AllSetCheckIcon, SpendStatementIcon (billing)\n- DetachIcon (compute, volumes)\n- PauseIcon (compute)\n- UpdatedIcon (settings)\n\nThird-party OS brand badges (Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, Rocky, Talos) and\nthe Civo logo badge are intentionally left in the micro-frontends.","tree":{"sha":"b07490f7d302f76efa29709a6bdfd66a5de272aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/b07490f7d302f76efa29709a6bdfd66a5de272aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/528cfa9c570b88af48bb4bb391f89707e2f69494","verification":{"payload":"tree b07490f7d302f76efa29709a6bdfd66a5de272aa\nparent 0880b558ea5b4d9c66a02bfd6e05d22a4943bb80\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1788453429 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788453429 -0400\n\n✨ feat: add AllSetCheck, Detach, Pause, SpendStatement and Updated icons (#714)\n\nBrings into the library the custom icons that lived only in the Civo\nmicro-frontends so they can be consumed from @konstructio/ui/icons:\n\n- AllSetCheckIcon, SpendStatementIcon (billing)\n- DetachIcon (compute, volumes)\n- PauseIcon (compute)\n- UpdatedIcon (settings)\n\nThird-party OS brand badges (Ubuntu, Debian, Fedora, Rocky, Talos) and\nthe Civo logo badge are intentionally left in the micro-frontends.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmaI1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkbwQALD3QDSZVtPvqG3LAJzqEs7h\ndGgStxxDllLpvQ97l9UWKEmLHl2OXo31RaWt/wi0fp2L8AV1daUBnc6r4zcxLf2y\neu1DZdVFw9Njiho5KgOGsexDdIR4fHxmwYwoF5iYJ0gQYy86AHdkRVPblM8t8Fwk\ndrHvx1zjmDPUMK6AtSzpHYSqEodn7dVIOraHBSnIuCWA0dGEjFVSoIh+tmSO4hrN\nVLaDUUuFaG+Cdy1FjfDfF69D49a9nwOwH6s6WHWsO6wkbm5hyxPLfI5I49JpdUCA\nivLPzA7/ZET6VdxAlFx4rjkpXbkgGnot7YihV+k8FMqDFbibO/aAcmV2VHNAqJDV\nXKEJoSgVSRNf919KJ3dL/DNzzWmROmef1AQgPUTjeLwZgwBySr0hItvVqT0IOMn3\ndxlLQ1jiBRWDKygCHJwl/R7hrT6Cp+SXRAWfNsqJV2tOSXCZcUydWQltZSmtsXnG\ngB73E3kHFRlW6L/a1MH2SjH8HoU0xNioMLNW6gnE3iQnnQJI12kaJ6Ex/E6n3qEd\nsb2pt7/5BYjaNIrySDigKF6MOG6jSD0NTO61sbENI1678y3bhr3zV2ZKQCgd3HK+\nilk8NWvjGqqF4lSJj0GIxoc+GdtPd8slWRllf/doTd4JAZVtIxGEh9yAHykMsHlk\nP069ELP+XHTdrecsvwV0\n=lQdl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T16:37:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/528cfa9c570b88af48bb4bb391f89707e2f69494","node_id":"C_kwDOM3rbOdoAKDUyOGNmYTljNTcwYjg4YWY0OGJiNGJiMzkxZjg5NzA3ZTJmNjk0OTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/0880b558ea5b4d9c66a02bfd6e05d22a4943bb80","sha":"0880b558ea5b4d9c66a02bfd6e05d22a4943bb80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/0880b558ea5b4d9c66a02bfd6e05d22a4943bb80"}],"sha":"528cfa9c570b88af48bb4bb391f89707e2f69494","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/528cfa9c570b88af48bb4bb391f89707e2f69494"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7634296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/futjesus","id":7634296,"login":"futjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/0880b558ea5b4d9c66a02bfd6e05d22a4943bb80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:24:59Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T16:24:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"✨ feat: add isPortal mode to VirtualizedTable.Actions (#713)\n\nThe row actions menu rendered as an `absolute` element inside the table, so\nany `overflow-x-auto` scroll container clipped it. Several microfronts\n(compute, kubernetes, databases, volumes, vpc) worked around it with local\ncopies that portal a `position: fixed` menu. This ports that behaviour into\nthe library behind an opt-in `isPortal` prop; the default stays inline.\n\nPortal mode:\n- Menu rendered with `createPortal` into `document.body`, positioned from the\n  trigger rect and flipped above when it does not fit below the viewport.\n- Hover opens on desktop and leaving closes after a short delay; a mouse click\n  never closes it. Touch taps toggle, and touch pointer enter/leave are ignored\n  because browsers fire them around every tap.\n- Full keyboard support: Enter/Space toggle, arrows open focusing first/last\n  item, Home/End/Tab navigate, Escape closes and refocuses the trigger.\n- Scroll in any container or window resize repositions the menu instead of\n  closing it; outside click, Escape and window blur close it.\n- The menu stays mounted (hidden) after the first open so actions rendered\n  through `component` (e.g. AlertDialog) survive the menu closing.\n- The row gets `data-actions-open` while open and Body paints it as hovered.\n\nStructure: Actions.tsx dispatches to InlineActions/PortalActions, which share\nActionsTrigger, ActionsList and the CVA variants. Action `component` is now\ntyped as `ElementType`.","tree":{"sha":"0e7a5299bb34043ac446d78296a914dbde0ffd77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/0e7a5299bb34043ac446d78296a914dbde0ffd77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/0880b558ea5b4d9c66a02bfd6e05d22a4943bb80","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e7a5299bb34043ac446d78296a914dbde0ffd77\nparent 0cd4df8f34f5cafc87e50d9994b0926a97de046c\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1788452699 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788452699 -0400\n\n✨ feat: add isPortal mode to VirtualizedTable.Actions (#713)\n\nThe row actions menu rendered as an `absolute` element inside the table, so\nany `overflow-x-auto` scroll container clipped it. Several microfronts\n(compute, kubernetes, databases, volumes, vpc) worked around it with local\ncopies that portal a `position: fixed` menu. This ports that behaviour into\nthe library behind an opt-in `isPortal` prop; the default stays inline.\n\nPortal mode:\n- Menu rendered with `createPortal` into `document.body`, positioned from the\n  trigger rect and flipped above when it does not fit below the viewport.\n- Hover opens on desktop and leaving closes after a short delay; a mouse click\n  never closes it. Touch taps toggle, and touch pointer enter/leave are ignored\n  because browsers fire them around every tap.\n- Full keyboard support: Enter/Space toggle, arrows open focusing first/last\n  item, Home/End/Tab navigate, Escape closes and refocuses the trigger.\n- Scroll in any container or window resize repositions the menu instead of\n  closing it; outside click, Escape and window blur close it.\n- The menu stays mounted (hidden) after the first open so actions rendered\n  through `component` (e.g. AlertDialog) survive the menu closing.\n- The row gets `data-actions-open` while open and Body paints it as hovered.\n\nStructure: Actions.tsx dispatches to InlineActions/PortalActions, which share\nActionsTrigger, ActionsList and the CVA variants. Action `component` is now\ntyped as `ElementType`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmZ9bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6JwQAGniFPZzFi3JabS51RSDMRH+\nFmqq2WxZPVbzIrHqli8VWlRixOEFLfQAo9HSJcCFMkqN1FTNHiPlgpBy0XW5SKPO\nKPuzp3HhvfDNGsL4E/h6ua38ye5AMqRr6HN5tyD64Fau9KZhiXfnY+RIEQAl2Clp\nUe2Bg5GfJLDsNpgI/P05oPqGqKDtcN5t1gd5W5e1Tlw5t1ZDu/qn8Xr0sXqgHLTT\nmRMp0JYIy1v6+JaI5xENGOB5zJj6B/TadPvDDg8Nvj1UC+ja5ZW