ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7634296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/futjesus","id":7634296,"login":"futjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/749113165faf77ac7adb0bda135e1e54c612aabc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T16:31:02Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T16:31:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"📝 docs: rewrite README with real-world installation and usage guide (#695)\n\nRewrites the README based on how the Civo micro-frontends actually\nconsume the library:\n\n- Add npm/license/Storybook badges and replace the WIP banner with a\n  concise alpha-status note\n- Document all peer dependencies (react, tailwindcss v4,\n  @tanstack/react-query, react-router-dom) which were previously\n  missing\n- Restructure setup into three steps: CSS imports, Tailwind @source\n  registration, and ThemeProvider\n- Add usage examples for components, the icons entry point, and the cn\n  utility, taken from real consumer imports\n- Document theming via useTheme/setTheme and the data-theme attribute\n  used by micro-frontend host shells\n- Add a categorized component overview, development commands, and fix\n  license links to point at LICENSE.md","tree":{"sha":"2d544336b1ad12b767742c8296fd26cc7ea47596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/2d544336b1ad12b767742c8296fd26cc7ea47596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/749113165faf77ac7adb0bda135e1e54c612aabc","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d544336b1ad12b767742c8296fd26cc7ea47596\nparent b09c1115ec0f425cb8eb607543302cc8657b5073\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1785947462 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785947462 -0400\n\n📝 docs: rewrite README with real-world installation and usage guide (#695)\n\nRewrites the README based on how the Civo micro-frontends actually\nconsume the library:\n\n- Add npm/license/Storybook badges and replace the WIP banner with a\n  concise alpha-status note\n- Document all peer dependencies (react, tailwindcss v4,\n  @tanstack/react-query, react-router-dom) which were previously\n  missing\n- Restructure setup into three steps: CSS imports, Tailwind @source\n  registration, and ThemeProvider\n- Add usage examples for components, the icons entry point, and the cn\n  utility, taken from real consumer imports\n- Document theming via useTheme/setTheme and the data-theme attribute\n  used by micro-frontend host shells\n- Add a categorized component overview, development commands, and fix\n  license links to point at LICENSE.md","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqc2VGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIrkQADu3329CbXeN+DMwK4tte3T5\ngPJyASvpb8xl0aw0i63eCFwBHA2NWexTm9234XV8WHGAVQN+tPR6w0PM/tgLwK0R\nr8MC0wqWsL/29xH46eygzduVemx3F6mNrfnk6cazjvg9SePJMHAM8Ivc8LvYKQWK\nX7jXuGpb8bzsNHhIHA0orQsBBHDw7HZuxnWtBgW71qQk+F/b0aAZM6ud2PFJ5N4L\nmrNFPGCAyu9N4G2o3XWykcWOTzkjTWFVMJ7ndftQ+9AUh21eUf4cAI5fx8NqdkHn\n4mjCN83Eda+j+SMY7G8eNGhM3QeuTlMVI9pKjBEaBjspzV/C4/2puspeZD7u33IO\nduqjnU/wC/eRx2L3IpLuOSnR9Me5htTPHu