s://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7634296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/futjesus","id":7634296,"login":"futjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/8ffd68ba643784e6509bc048313317c319ed8481/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T15:18:30Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T15:18:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"⬆️ chore: update dependencies to latest stable (#692)\n\n* ⬆️ chore: update dependencies to latest stable\n\nBumps 20 packages: motion 13 (major), vite 8.2, storybook 10.5.6,\nlucide-react 1.28, @typescript-eslint 8.66, plus patch-level updates to\n@tanstack/react-virtual, countries-and-timezones, google-libphonenumber,\njsdom, postcss, @testing-library/user-event and assorted @types.\n\nRejects @tanstack/react-table v9: it is still beta, and the release is an\narchitecture rewrite rather than a drop-in bump (useReactTable -> useTable,\nexplicit feature registration, Table gaining a second generic, enableSorting\nand enableResizing moving off ColumnDef, an extra CellContext generic). It\nbreaks ~28 type errors across 10 VirtualizedTable files and deserves its own\nmigration PR once v9 reaches GA.\n\nLockfile regenerated from scratch so the top-level @emnapi/* entries survive,\nand verified with a Linux amd64 npm ci.\n\n* 🔧 chore: replace __dirname with import.meta.dirname in vite configs\n\nVite warns that both configs use `__dirname`, which the `configLoader: ''native''`\nloader does not support and which is planned to become the default in a future\nmajor. The configs only work today because Vite transpiles them to CJS first.\n\nAlso bumps .nvmrc to v24.19.0 — jsdom 30.0.1 requires\nnode ^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0, which the previous v24.18.0 satisfied but\nwhich is worth keeping current now that the toolchain is verified against it.\n\n* 📝 docs: tighten dependency update rules in CLAUDE.md\n\nRecords three rules learned while running this update: use deps:update without\n--interactive, keep peerDependencies ranges in sync with what is actually built\nand tested, and regenerate the lockfile from scratch so the @emnapi/* entries\nthat Linux npm ci needs are not pruned by a macOS install.","tree":{"sha":"2530a904b734b67a2efa9632fabe20d3406cee33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/2530a904b734b67a2efa9632fabe20d3406cee33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/8ffd68ba643784e6509bc048313317c319ed8481","verification":{"payload":"tree 2530a904b734b67a2efa9632fabe20d3406cee33\nparent 88d6bf2355c9fcd1d6dbdff9a1fdce572028ee4b\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1785943110 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785943110 -0400\n\n⬆️ chore: update dependencies to latest stable (#692)\n\n* ⬆️ chore: update dependencies to latest stable\n\nBumps 20 packages: motion 13 (major), vite 8.2, storybook 10.5.6,\nlucide-react 1.28, @typescript-eslint 8.66, plus patch-level updates to\n@tanstack/react-virtual, countries-and-timezones, google-libphonenumber,\njsdom, postcss, @testing-library/user-event and assorted @types.\n\nRejects @tanstack/react-table v9: it is still beta, and the release is an\narchitecture rewrite rather than a drop-in bump (useReactTable -> useTable,\nexplicit feature registration, Table gaining a second generic, enableSorting\nand enableResizing moving off ColumnDef, an extra CellContext generic). It\nbreaks ~28 type errors across 10 VirtualizedTable files and deserves its own\nmigration PR once v9 reaches GA.\n\nLockfile regenerated from scratch so the top-level @emnapi/* entries survive,\nand verified with a Linux amd64 npm ci.\n\n* 🔧 chore: replace __dirname with import.meta.dirname in vite configs\n\nVite warns that both configs use `__dirname`, which the `configLoader: ''native''`\nloader does not support and which is planned to become the default in a future\nmajor. The configs only work today because Vite transpiles them to CJS first.\n\nAlso bumps .nvmrc to v24.19.0 — jsdom 30.0.1 requires\nnode ^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0, which the previous v24.18.0 satisfied but\nwhich is worth keeping current now that the toolchain is verified against it.\n\n* 📝 docs: tighten dependency update rules in CLAUDE.md\n\nRecords three rules learned while running this update: use deps:update without\n--interactive, keep peerDependencies ranges in sync with what is actually built\nand tested, and regenerate the lockfile from scratch so the @emnapi/* entries\nthat Linux npm ci needs are not pruned by a macOS install.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqc1RGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKKwQAKB+4zPY1/LejUY6Jvtxk5CF\n2LIPXaBvIQo1jql+js3fcVFbpmVrMT294Ao0N75G304IofEIALB6UDSR1/hrVoTc\nX0dVztQgEorzLGB7cAB0qg+hwzOvMZmR2/odRBhCRY38O8uk8UzwnM8CjBAVjSVI\n3jEGtID1NVffaSI56j4oeaU+unkvRdxF81n3foFVjt6AjhLQaUfY/G1Ri+LPBm+P\nOf445rQ8kGFFgMrWU6xwP2u9mysy9ZqblzCR43y1jQKskz8/RAMorvNup6xv9+AG\nwPGwGU8GKPIyzT5EFxPa692jAqBSSO6GnJhy943XG2pRC5Wc4GSmcPAl3rmlmFJR\nKeYtq1e3aW/wb6I9R9vHzZLBt2SO9iM+CqqjdYsjdaZohenQWxydG5u+L+OMAIQP\n062VP