ean props read better defaulting to false: `showOnCollapse` (default\nfalse) replaces `hideOnCollapse` (default true). Same default behavior —\nthe logo content hides in collapsed mode unless opted in.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2fec965d1875dff2585fe3aaad9ba348ddca0d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/a2fec965d1875dff2585fe3aaad9ba348ddca0d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/3d4e0b5e1ab35c4a182faaed01fd04a16a374f29","verification":{"payload":"tree a2fec965d1875dff2585fe3aaad9ba348ddca0d7\nparent b504c07bbacc1b6b4213d3ee79605ab1bb4d6d1c\nauthor Jairo Fernández <jairofg12@gmail.com> 1785168956 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785168956 -0400\n\n✨ feat: add Sidebar collapse trigger and logo visibility options (#679)\n\n* ✨ feat: add Sidebar collapse trigger to expand auto-collapsed sidebar\n\n* ✨ feat: enhance Sidebar collapse behavior with logo visibility options\n\n* ♻️ refactor: rename Logo hideOnCollapse prop to showOnCollapse\n\nBoolean props read better defaulting to false: `showOnCollapse` (default\nfalse) replaces `hideOnCollapse` (default true). Same default behavior —\nthe logo content hides in collapsed mode unless opted in.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZ4Q8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsXQQAEUaz2+CPs2yle9JUYe0vT/L\njO0ZGLBhzZ/UDslZBBKKnrn4GiD+aYj17RcoSkBz8b8XaYvCsGD283gYRnHhv1hs\nCLRERga799C/QiPPTpwTyDF0skDrHcYolutESOyhZSkceLjWBt13bc4nV/bdsDiq\nDO8jmKVjaCq3lfImS/Tbs9M79ZUhDCD96k9UdB7k/7AxENJlQ9muJEoudkRrHgur\nj9jd0zSorerb5iYCEJsKaM/LNbTYUvocOqcxdRDvvgjuaZEXkBETkX57tD4klt8j\ngccl0aWfDOjUqxNT0gilgpXjU/981jRchMwluIfjRDwovbvD9hAbiyc3cnzDCvXz\nJlG1cqgovUTtJqoS2Vjjst///zV8NFQ0gQeXnA+v3/mKyWX1a