lette slots their stale v3 values came from\n- Add theme tokens for the sidebar hover/text colors and the Tag mistery\n  green (kubefirst-dark-blue-200/300/800, mistery)\n- Convert even-px arbitrary values to the Tailwind v4 numeric scale\n  (max-h-[250px] -> max-h-62.5, w-[200px] -> w-50, ...)\n- Replace bracket utilities that have canonical equivalents\n  (-translate-y-1/2, left-1/2, top-1, z-60)\n- PieChart default colors now resolve from theme variables via resolveColor\n  instead of hardcoded hex","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZ3yKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2N0QADV6EQh0Eva36ChD9q9g6GdT\n9GsINxCi2PZIBC/ods18UaurAX2hYBzhvNtwCBTOU2K4JKPWMgG0WbASTqs4SgaC\naEPpKKWJC37hBzuOKyyjopZqqXBP2b9Y0l6wS7dH2FIaNuTz/A3lYP2WOSi1UB0E\niTrdIpuY4y8dZOE1w1ZJuBsSb6I9mlAd4CkCJUTjzHowpUYUMLUfuDwjGS2DWLzD\nLb9Z4vERNH8ZqZ/rHBOYskKZEMW7iVfNkJ/Eg2QdjGbUT2LJHUT+hzzcoSTnCT32\nIjS/35icNUb2gEUTMTg9b9QCFzNM9H7kcnir4QuMPmRi+DM71gJT/RUNIuKNTPsF\nLUYWPM/w5eVEInIPo859qe35dCX2fjatNc3x4MlJgJ+jHoGT5KautXn8oWmR4qLE\ng2C0vXl8YKFCQafXmDQc/tdVQMJ5QymLBPzjr0oD+xbnGzmWGYs0lKuLUOOJOkrs\n4Pc2hh/0qwecEyT0o07Km+sFnc0ZbSQVA4wy3j9GfMvWgqGFh/XCR9vsDxSi41BQ\nr2x3xWD7Vn5azV0svSIAbCPc4859HX28J0BLYVm1bbV7JktA725AA2DXwp6rkxqZ\nlz4TMIa8V86+SPne3LSliixwjI4mnJZa8fQi2N9HK5s9pSZOBfpB6rharBOMlVXA\n4NJTKUF2jKAENzzJRPks\n=2Hc8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-27T15:43:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/46bd52c3d72b8740ac37d1fdaca4523363668dc4","node_id":"C_kwDOM3rbOdoAKDQ2YmQ1MmMzZDcyYjg3NDBhYzM3ZDFmZGFjYTQ1MjMzNjM2NjhkYzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/d7e056803a6d1ba121a89150a47145a2c708e9bd","sha":"d7e056803a6d1ba121a89150a47145a2c708e9bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/d7e056803a6d1ba121a89150a47145a2c708e9bd"}],"sha":"46bd52c3d72b8740ac37d1fdaca4523363668dc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/46bd52c3d72b8740ac37d1fdaca4523363668dc4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7634296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/futjesus","id":7634296,"login":"futjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/d7e056803a6d1ba121a89150a47145a2c708e9bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:37:46Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T15:37:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"✨ feat: focus the search input when opening a searchable Select (#674)\n\n* ✨ feat: focus the search input when opening a searchable Select\n\nClicking the combobox in searchable mode now opens the options and focuses\nthe search input so the user can type immediately. Tab navigation is\nunchanged: the combobox stays the tab stop and the input keeps tabIndex=-1.\nhandleOpen previously focused the hidden inert input, which was a no-op.\n\n* 🐛 fix: clear the phone input mask timer when unmounted while focused\n\n@react-input/mask polls the selection with a self-rescheduling timeout that\nit only clears on blur, and detaching the node never fires blur, so the\nchain kept running after unmount. Blur the node from a callback ref before\nhanding null to the mask proxy, while its listeners are still attached.\n\nThis surfaced in CI as an unhandled \"window is not defined\" ReferenceError\nonce the jsdom environment was torn down under the leaked timer.","tree":{"sha":"89f08fcab4254041ebadd85deb113eae4f071139","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/89f08fcab4254041ebadd85deb113eae4f071139"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/d7e056803a6d1ba121a89150a47145a2c708e9bd","verification":{"payload":"tree 89f08fcab4254041ebadd85deb113eae4f071139\nparent 3b90440bcce0b26d5bc5f4c78c9ef116159ec6aa\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1785166666 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785166666 -0400\n\n✨ feat: focus the search input when opening a searchable Select (#674)\n\n* ✨ feat: focus the search input when opening a searchable Select\n\nClicking the combobox in searchable mode now opens the options and focuses\nthe search input so the user can type immediately. Tab navigation is\nunchanged: the combobox stays the tab stop and the input keeps tabIndex=-1.\nhandleOpen previously focused the hidden inert input, which was a no-op.\n\n* 🐛 fix: clear the phone input mask timer when unmounted while focused\n\n@react-input/mask polls the selection with a self-rescheduling timeout that\nit only clears on blur, and detaching the node never fires blur, so the\nchain kept running after unmount. Blur the node from a callback ref before\nhanding null to the mask proxy, while its listeners are still attached.\n\nThis surfaced in CI as an unhandled \"window is not defined\" ReferenceError\nonce the jsdom environment was torn down under the leaked timer.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZ3tKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7d4QAB5bFkzvTHRIsxPUv+7i4EFq\nURRDjHnprFo3teR7htdmi5F2JVymLuVz+TUlI44hS/Q9ufKnTgpCrT6gXbKc03T7\nZrrLXQpluEak8pgniiZ5hrtQmJkT+bcjq4+ak4BIslhZNZM+irx5YCDp77MvOllG\nJh9jOywptbOEku/NwtUpoYjdJbNO76n6EjRfwEo4HYXyraVZFbxf4My4PMjCYw4v\nnRP8STcWf1yVzcxtQ3nEa9pkhPcGQzWhy+ZGwjD5WxiT3c7UPEobIF/0BUkZ75oP\nTMZwy2sFckQF+dO/SLbX9X/j5x0XZ1fqFjdENvGfvRSJjobiAXp5cNxlUrcHwlEc\nQaWDjpY6isiyQZlapgUz34n4WMlQGyPq0q7EbbMuVxXZo6+3a+7YJtYouAVTJv6f\n4aePeauQ7pSc3CGpKbbU8a8bQod5X36Z6XfxvfX9S/cMihc2kHdrisGzrYS8jMOC\nTq8x5OGWehD/nPXJ+lAzzjlfdKbntdBgMwI8LR7CWFUL5D4WVJ/ydqld3sgNqjWF\nY/ibylZB5K59sbXQpoBEXz8p8xAL2orInCq7HU1hcbOdXikaRyDBN385/auS0KxI\nTNi3NMFl2G6xT/OedGmx0podaxsqyGHgWnrpY0X/5Y5YkJMpvkFVlXIgYO2/LxrV\nU39DLkE4BEvDdG+58fRw\n=6ZgN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-27T15:37:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-fl