orkflow (#671)\n\n- tests.yml now runs lint, check:types, check:prettier and tests with\n  coverage instead of only vitest run\n- Enforce coverage thresholds (63/56/60/64) as a ratchet floor, measured\n  against current coverage after excluding auto-generated icon assets\n- New storybook-check.yml builds Storybook on PRs touching lib, .storybook\n  or the package manifests, so a broken Storybook is caught before deploy","tree":{"sha":"f4d96412ee9ff3f995cfeff6bf807f8ae38c42cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/f4d96412ee9ff3f995cfeff6bf807f8ae38c42cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/f2e045d951cd2d58c462080243c175ebb2d46a8a","verification":{"payload":"tree f4d96412ee9ff3f995cfeff6bf807f8ae38c42cf\nparent 6750580cd8f5e31fcc2ca1b0d73618afd9832b23\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1785164119 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785164119 -0400\n\n👷 ci: add lint, types, prettier and coverage gates to PR workflow (#671)\n\n- tests.yml now runs lint, check:types, check:prettier and tests with\n  coverage instead of only vitest run\n- Enforce coverage thresholds (63/56/60/64) as a ratchet floor, measured\n  against current coverage after excluding auto-generated icon assets\n- New storybook-check.yml builds Storybook on PRs touching lib, .storybook\n  or the package manifests, so a broken Storybook is caught before deploy","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZ3FXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVrYQAHqqLqry2FTdjsQHmluseKoV\n9YG73F1R+geVIBz4g8kFnn7XQKt7AL1Zbwxy1Klz8YpN6yafkVn+IoDUxHmQLv/M\nR9FQjKlMDSuDgr1gI2g60kMjXZqiiZpR+YzSjWjdcJ9w+RS0OqQzNcmO7qbyq0EF\n5GGN9b4J4DU0Td4WB9+hLbUta+SdVgtWjLrTK0bFrx2/4zba1RHvVq7xHveXa5ct\nftlOs4pD6nveBHhRKNXp049z+GZmp7Hg1QV2xvDVlEjlT6mOFq6DmRH71bIWHLR7\nPvzRIm2kcSuSfebF28Mjv5rD5GcIAn3HGNE3OZ9lhI4ZkDy9yaeS//C+NFztXXzw\naSD8sVx3MrGTWPvnhUgaShJo6sWnnA4vYrWp3wDvTyiMVj4Qs0Bh/XLHjWJ/qfl7\nUkXxc3RbrJ8FORsG7J1CAnIZYH5zB