x stale docs: CLAUDE.md conventions (spaces/ESLint, not tabs/Biome) and\n  README Tailwind v4 setup (konstructPlugin no longer exists)\n- Rename misnamed RadioGroup.stories.tsx to RadioCard.stories.tsx","tree":{"sha":"6b2387e4ac06cf42c3984d1f421d72cbdaa13547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/6b2387e4ac06cf42c3984d1f421d72cbdaa13547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/6750580cd8f5e31fcc2ca1b0d73618afd9832b23","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b2387e4ac06cf42c3984d1f421d72cbdaa13547\nparent 17d904234032aceac036d374d8eb09c6577c23a3\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1785163490 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785163490 -0400\n\n🐛 fix: correct misspelled filter event names with legacy compatibility (#670)\n\n- Rename ''@konstrtuctio/KonstructFilter'' event strings to ''@konstructio/...'';\n  legacy names still dispatched and listened to (deduped via a duplicate\n  marker) so old hardcoded strings and mixed library versions keep working\n- Extract useFilterDropdownSync to replace the listener blocks copy-pasted\n  across the four filter dropdown hooks\n- Add shared useClickOutside hook and replace seven identical copies\n- Add getTableId util for the tableId computation repeated in VirtualizedTable\n- Memoize Modal and Command context provider values\n- Fix build script race: rimraf ran in background with a single ''&''\n- Exclude auto-generated lib/assets icons from coverage stats\n- Fix stale docs: CLAUDE.md conventions (spaces/ESLint, not tabs/Biome) and\n  README Tailwind v4 setup (konstructPlugin no longer exists)\n- Rename misnamed RadioGroup.stories.tsx to RadioCard.stories.tsx","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZ27iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKA0QADUYW+8HLbtOFDH/qDIuiVIi\n9UvTAXGX8wnFwi8WeShPGQi8jTDRyeU56vZAcZ5EAnj2pllEcySxaXvhJ5ILaxfs\n4TltXOB5EEU1At63uTUS1DXN0NE759rL7PYK9OtOlsspQiB7nzbGoUjUt9/7p7kH\nSQ74g8R9nM/ihGlcSx+QW