inner child runs an infinite spin animation whose animationend events reached the badge listener and removed the badge, so loading badges never rendered. Register the listener only while the badge is hidden and ignore events whose target is not the badge itself.","tree":{"sha":"6c3d5d68badb8d8c3e39fcacbd468a3a278402f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/6c3d5d68badb8d8c3e39fcacbd468a3a278402f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/ed1a2de6d63cc36ae8166b908d08abe3f58e5347","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c3d5d68badb8d8c3e39fcacbd468a3a278402f2\nparent e9ee74040f2c6d52ad1f26f6ecf55ac83f91eb22\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1784834113 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784834113 -0400\n\n🐛 fix: keep loading Badge mounted when its spinner animation ends (#668)\n\nThe animationend listener that removes a dismissed badge was registered unconditionally, and animation events bubble. In loading mode the spinner child runs an infinite spin animation whose animationend events reached the badge listener and removed the badge, so loading badges never rendered. Register the listener only while the badge is hidden and ignore events whose target is not the badge itself.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYmhBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5PYQAH5ZAA12ITKA6NUvetEQkGTu\nuwjQ8E6+Zq2CdX1fxY67vFk55s748OndhFp23JE0wIiAXCMm+MaOxFq2+nUYQ2Wi\nCsy2fOhNxKF7nrVjwJW5S2TFm1bpEr658um85FzdJpUpmNy+amoF4jVGpkGkAXd0\nPNwQNM5784HczS/V2suvbB34ssA8JgIoEb48DaEXq398XQiOiSvE7jt7v8+k8T7P\nyvBmFRBZcW8hg2lsVxuhYkPXen/6dInnqth1kVjJ+vl61ZbAcFfZv59D1ZRTNQuV\ncP3lMrBdj2w18Ahyv1YKNvGJrcnf1FvffPfCjSouzjyvAVu/glqFOBKauJ8wtDPu\n+i8PyWxfBY7iya7KJGE+lTdwhJm9JDBLv4YQHu47kEBlo8yqiur3mBULvSXa2Q8g\nQTNDfEZbZGTyDThNKbD7IAj5Nhi4uev9QbdKrjx1zcSdY965DtTb+sQsIIeaxE6x\nqxVc6npBmK+M9JiTaq//6YiKlo6/JQvu27ENLCUbORLaDuEj0L/klXxikrTwJ3ES\nx+iz5O171MdoG4/0fUEL85VpoKePQLjOh6gxWbnJK2viBKTkC8qb3h1OXz/