in the release (#667)\n\nnpm install -g npm@latest now resolves to npm@12, which requires node\n^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26 and failed with EBADENGINE against the\nnode pinned in .nvmrc (v24.13.1), breaking the npm publish job.","tree":{"sha":"05bfb7d9343e682e199a9559ada72cbc5ea6da98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/05bfb7d9343e682e199a9559ada72cbc5ea6da98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/37f3c8c28f38b80ac32a84206b1c1573769e8d9d","verification":{"payload":"tree 05bfb7d9343e682e199a9559ada72cbc5ea6da98\nparent da9e4895534a03dcae5ff3fe77f299c249c683a4\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1784667979 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784667979 -0400\n\n💚 ci: bump node to v24.18.0 so npm@latest installs in the release (#667)\n\nnpm install -g npm@latest now resolves to npm@12, which requires node\n^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26 and failed with EBADENGINE against the\nnode pinned in .nvmrc (v24.13.1), breaking the npm publish job.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX99LCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAc3YQACDjjK/FPwluNzqesxFBblgc\nITsPnSJAlOWs6GAHTzGT7ANJjSTZA42un3zq5TYomQvkZnExxs+zCATAfFtnr2V5\nh94W+8nY5tozjVNjtIpXppA7ZvjnHq/IHckAbir9JdQj+ME3BqZj1HAqgSIjxXgJ\nE7Yi6pafkgaBtICi2jZYShGHXkCnW/UkQd/FIFu1Z4izdKf1NGhkvkWv2T1CLBNv\nfcUfRGgfU4jbpmR5VJBDYHgK2P27A+FT1KZlwSVRaNHzZesJC/Tg4AXNMC4t8gL+\n7BDaBtnWkYppJ6xow28avOo33O0Z/+0uHPv0Sz7Ceh6MKj0gPH6Bd6WMHyERuBdk\nQxUR9HNpHM1P6qons/lFA1bxU0YLipXZLx2c4SHQp/x+6sEAxUCWL2dDuJ6br33v\nqUzUEYJ/m/Z50qOTZHzImIMVt9ws5DIusFCchql0U9rnVJg9UEBIn/rlXcHegiP0\nPO8kGBYXO/V7bZVmiwaii0HnTH7+MmOUUFl5B3wmFAaKuuWDOayitPAF5+s+rVBg\n05q4iRXLYsdYU96di7U1MDZyNLjfhYttX95A+FTnGfg+ZNRy7kHyhXA+XYH1/qve\nrkLu8zXwaGYHFxNuv7GDG+w0zAu7omO7G5yw/NOuXQTPnIlfQFprsCXpn3O4QnsT\nxikdtoqB2Bf7hPPZ53h3\n=EDMj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T21:06:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi