1d2fedbfe7353927aeb348867a","node_id":"C_kwDOM3rbOdoAKGMyNGU4YWRkNTFjOGUwMWQyZmVkYmZlNzM1MzkyN2FlYjM0ODg2N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/1275b25c0a6825cb7dc358c8357ac6d67c8c4e6b","sha":"1275b25c0a6825cb7dc358c8357ac6d67c8c4e6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/1275b25c0a6825cb7dc358c8357ac6d67c8c4e6b"}],"sha":"c24e8add51c8e01d2fedbfe7353927aeb348867a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/c24e8add51c8e01d2fedbfe7353927aeb348867a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3932407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jairoFernandez","id":3932407,"login":"jairoFernandez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzI0MDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/1275b25c0a6825cb7dc358c8357ac6d67c8c4e6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T22:28:33Z","email":"jairofg12@gmail.com","name":"Jairo Fernandez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T22:28:33Z","email":"jairofg12@gmail.com","name":"Jairo Fernandez"},"message":"🐛 fix: improve table actions menu usability\n\nThe row actions (kebab) menu had two usability issues:\n\n1. It closed when moving the cursor diagonally toward the options. The\n   gap between the trigger and the panel used a margin that collapsed\n   outside the hoverable area, and the menu toggled via display with no\n   grace period.\n2. On the last rows the panel was clipped by the table body wrapper\n   (overflow-hidden), hiding the lower options behind the pagination.\n\n- Replace the margin gap with padding on the toggled wrapper so the\n  trigger, bridge and panel form a continuous hover region.\n- Toggle via visibility/opacity: opens instantly on hover, waits 150ms\n  before closing so diagonal moves re-enter.\n- Open the panel upward when there is not enough room below within the\n  clipping container, so options are never hidden.","tree":{"sha":"5017489a366ed92006931d5fe9a2ee5fef61a73a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/5017489a366ed92006931d5fe9a2ee5fef61a73a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/1275b25c0a6825cb7dc358c8357ac6d67c8c4e6b","verification":{"payload":"tree 5017489a366ed92006931d5fe9a2ee5fef61a73a\nparent afb1f531619c9466e7ee125df7d131d246cdb484\nauthor Jairo Fernandez <jairofg12@gmail.com> 1782858513 -0500\ncommitter Jairo Fernandez <jairofg12@gmail.com> 1782858513 -0500\n\n🐛 fix: improve table actions menu usability\n\nThe row actions (kebab) menu had two usability issues:\n\n1. It closed when moving the cursor diagonally toward the options. The\n   gap between the trigger and the panel used a margin that collapsed\n   outside the hoverable area, and the menu toggled via display with no\n   grace period.\n2. On the last rows the panel was clipped by the table body wrapper\n   (overflow-hidden), hiding the lower options behind the pagination.\n\n- Replace the margin gap with padding on the toggled wrapper so the\n  trigger, bridge and panel form a continuous hover region.\n- Toggle via visibility/opacity: opens instantly on hover, waits 150ms\n  before closing so diagonal moves re-enter.\n- Open the panel upward when there is not enough room below within the\n  clipping container, so options are never hidden.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+7JONMgMrKFBldOKWa5u33PVUq\ndhfZp/L76D+SnYoCAAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQG7JesbtLZcCewVM/4ab+xO2Ikq+p0YJkClt3vpHh/EM4dwFZ6MEbpc4n7QlZbeYct\ngD4NpyaGVSfgN4qr6jMAQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-30T22:40:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3932407?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jairoFernandez","id":3932407,"login":"jairoFernandez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MzI0MDc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jairoFernandez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/1275b25c0a6825cb7dc358c8357ac6d67c8c4e6b","node_id":"C_kwDOM3rbOdoAKDEyNzViMjVjMGE2ODI1Y2I3ZGMzNThjODM1N2FjNmQ2N2M4YzRlNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/afb1f531619c9466e7ee125df7d131d246cdb484","sha":"afb1f531619c9466e7ee125df7d131d246cdb484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/af