"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/c0fe1ceac1ef32ea6dfc4bd87fd4d2cbb9470da0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173219915?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/konstruct-bot","id":173219915,"login":"konstruct-bot","node_id":"U_kgDOClMgSw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/c0fe1ceac1ef32ea6dfc4bd87fd4d2cbb9470da0","node_id":"C_kwDOM3rbOdoAKGMwZmUxY2VhYzFlZjMyZWE2ZGZjNGJkODdmZDRkMmNiYjk0NzBkYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/828fb9547ba46c51c94a9b45f3d1adc1c608ad1e","sha":"828fb9547ba46c51c94a9b45f3d1adc1c608ad1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/828fb9547ba46c51c94a9b45f3d1adc1c608ad1e"}],"sha":"c0fe1ceac1ef32ea6dfc4bd87fd4d2cbb9470da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/c0fe1ceac1ef32ea6dfc4bd87fd4d2cbb9470da0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7634296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/futjesus","id":7634296,"login":"futjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/828fb9547ba46c51c94a9b45f3d1adc1c608ad1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:41:38Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T23:41:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"🐛 fix: VirtualizedTable shows skeleton only on initial load, not on background refetch (#654)\n\nThe table Body gated the loading Skeleton on `tableFetching`\n(queryResult.isFetching), which is true on ANY fetch — including background\nrefetches driven by `refetchInterval` polling or `placeholderData:\nkeepPreviousData`. Two problems followed:\n\n- Every background refetch replaced the rows with the Skeleton (flicker).\n- Consumers that set `notifyOnChangeProps: [''data'',''error'']` to avoid that\n  flicker could get stuck: the render where data settles to an empty array\n  coincided with `isFetching: true`, so the Skeleton showed and the\n  `emptyState` never appeared (no further re-render to settle it).\n\nGate the Skeleton on `tableLoading` (queryResult.isLoading) instead — true only\nwhile fetching with no data to show (initial load). Background refetches now\nkeep the current rows and refresh silently, and an empty result reliably falls\nthrough to `emptyState`. The external `isLoading` prop still forces the\nSkeleton. `isFirstLoad`/`tableLoading` were already exposed by the provider.\n\nAdds Body tests covering initial-load skeleton, the external isLoading prop, and\na regression guard that the empty state survives a background refetch.","tree":{"sha":"d245465bcdaf3e2a6c7cd75b02dbe6d4f149c345","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/d245465bcdaf3e2a6c7cd75b02dbe6d4f149c345"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/828fb9547ba46c51c94a9b45f3d1adc1c608ad1e","verification":{"payload":"tree d245465bcdaf3e2a6c7cd75b02dbe6d4f149c345\nparent 6abc5f93e9f171c4adbe09dbd05d90b3a3c360f6\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1780616498 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780616498 -0400\n\n🐛 fix: VirtualizedTable shows skeleton only on initial load, not on background refetch (#654)\n\nThe table Body gated the loading Skeleton on `tableFetching`\n(queryResult.isFetching), which is true on ANY fetch — including background\nrefetches driven by `refetchInterval` polling or `placeholderData:\nkeepPreviousData`. Two problems followed:\n\n- Every background refetch replaced the rows with the Skeleton (flicker).\n- Consumers that set `notifyOnChangeProps: [''data'',''error'']` to avoid that\n  flicker could get stuck: the render where data settles to an empty array\n  coincided with `isFetching: true`, so the Skeleton showed and the\n  `emptyState` never appeared (no further re-render to settle it).\n\nGate the Skeleton on `tableLoading` (queryResult.isLoading) instead — true only\nwhile fetching with no data to show (initial load). Background refetches now\nkeep the current rows and refresh silently, and an empty result reliably falls\nthrough to `emptyState`. The external `isLoading` prop still forces the\nSkeleton. `isFirstLoad`/`tableLoading` were already exposed by the provider.\n\nAdds Body tests covering initial-load skeleton, the external isLoading prop, and\na regression guard that the empty state survives a background refetch.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqIg0yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4fIQACqEvCEqvLYHJvh3itROUX73\nmtBfWcbkK4VtWhQdVidHJJf4FwzJ3zaJJ28MxxYHV5l5zx1l4hIKgaJ5Lkc5bY3f\ngt7TteoIK6oG7ovoFG8oZdrz5N4pq90iGMz/sjL/Zpp7dVyuViCfGup9H4sHQDjl\nuQrfOT24G2TaAOJ1pnrj8gfZVVVxm0fE9wvmTTeYxtH0ZPc1iYfUSz5N0eI6P4Jx\ndxPNz7ReJSia4TGK9dqt3wmhKoDub9GSe74xSesPYMARC5kvoKhA2Qrpk78eDyxA\nELKX5YNW96R4YSXlVrUV4F5x6iwYjQOh7d3LsgelJqKFCPRnjPs+eMG5EfXXsxhH\nyb8NSWrbQ65BCW/3UDbiVkmCbG74TtGBzFhlD1/pIopWkQqXCG8E296i/7oFxsJ4\nPNcOERVTNFXVcM7DxcIWb5UWtPv+Vbq9VsOW9c7LJ8ZlulsgQG+4Y/CxMtMCh6WB\nQf3uWR2q/sRHQweUrnJWjuuBDpvppyH/ZEocd6JtNkQ9xbmzPhDCMgcednTrEv63\no6hGVlHUHE/9ec+cWu0aVB2lVk/iZJ7nhcRlw4YIPYSFY6NbzJja2iciBf+9qtIk\nzjQGkDaL0ODpwJEeAU8FFwkMQ7vtkJ1Fn4NvLbQwgukz4cYXtZPwKljASWyZuHWX\nizh1ab62hiQWhXPmqFgM\n=MyVF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-04T23:41:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":