etermination step and job output. Also\nremove the temporary OIDC debug step now that the cause is understood.\n\nTrade-off: the newest version is still always ''latest'', but the\nsecondary prerelease tag (e.g. alpha) is no longer set on npm.","tree":{"sha":"f6762da4e8e7611928a73e7e17bd1eb244469bb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/f6762da4e8e7611928a73e7e17bd1eb244469bb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/92dccf223454f485bccd5be2bc94f447514341a3","verification":{"payload":"tree f6762da4e8e7611928a73e7e17bd1eb244469bb3\nparent ff3d99ba708c592201a9b327560e1f89f329e08f\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1779898320 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779898320 -0400\n\n🔧 ci: publish latest-only via OIDC, drop unauthenticated dist-tag step (#644)\n\nnpm Trusted Publishing (OIDC) only authenticates `npm publish`, not\n`dist-tag`, so the secondary `npm dist-tag add` ran without credentials\nand failed with ENEEDAUTH. Publish with --tag latest in both registries\nand drop the now-unused dist-tag determination step and job output. Also\nremove the temporary OIDC debug step now that the cause is understood.\n\nTrade-off: the newest version is still always ''latest'', but the\nsecondary prerelease tag (e.g. alpha) is no longer set on npm.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFxfQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdk0QACg1vm3Q8vvFJnjcelCY0svI\n6HqSMyDJKkp4zaMDi9q4YpS3SFT0MDSFxXC2cG9RgDeOAKtrSy4DOa7satpIPBQ2\nzhlKeRFhWTGJZ4Zny0YxgOEGS1iOjAVVcoqlEQHouxe8Zu5Rc3ZxCB/Rw+H+Vg/3\nly7JmfRatGegrHGaNLAJmpmJtYFGSt6PznPmK4X9cQxMDofNjVl4tWAqAS94w3w9\nSP2ZiJ9wk6p5iqK+oUv1Oc6bQGylxcfVkUekaoThcxAFa7FQb3gcRoAFw6YxTMJ4\nA1+dT0zd1RAYX1CYGVYiJs6x212sn8JHzT9bciOiL7PgGvXAHc8ghoCnzovy/tZN\nWwaEMZKTFKGNb3xKDjA5I2NGbB4X4ZpRX5gXF77BSOjQ8FSjXfMZQ+CtB0E3jLcN\nwcJmsmxhCVRbu0IAadUHDhbIOX1/haVL7GcpM58M6QYOle2+hXQfC5H9c5mk/Qck\n2yGiu3wC5NR9UUHrVBcC8q4INzL7dIXKeO9ScX/PB1uGN6Ruq