type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konstruct-bot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/e07a86e4c0e4a4a2437c09e9ed822df1e2a80a40","node_id":"C_kwDOM3rbOdoAKGUwN2E4NmU0YzBlNGE0YTI0MzdjMDllOWVkODIyZGYxZTJhODBhNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commit/cb7b43569ff5c8c865633428618fb17e73511663","sha":"cb7b43569ff5c8c865633428618fb17e73511663","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/cb7b43569ff5c8c865633428618fb17e73511663"}],"sha":"e07a86e4c0e4a4a2437c09e9ed822df1e2a80a40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/e07a86e4c0e4a4a2437c09e9ed822df1e2a80a40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7634296?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/futjesus","id":7634296,"login":"futjesus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/cb7b43569ff5c8c865633428618fb17e73511663/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T15:46:59Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T15:46:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"🔍 ci: fix npm OIDC ENEEDAUTH (+provenance) and always tag latest (#643)\n\n* 🔍 ci: diagnose npm OIDC ENEEDAUTH with --provenance and debug step\n\npublish-npm fails with ENEEDAUTH (npm 11.8.0, id-token: write set, no\ntoken). npm CLI issue #9088 notes trusted-publishing failures surface as\na misleading ENEEDAUTH. Add --provenance to force the OIDC/id-token path\n(explicit error if id-token is missing) and a safe debug step reporting\nwhether the OIDC request env vars are present (no secret values printed).\n\n* 🏷️ ci: always tag the published version as latest\n\nPublish with --tag latest (atomic at publish time) so the newest version\nis always the npm/GitHub Packages latest regardless of its prerelease tag,\nthen add the prerelease tag (e.g. alpha) as a secondary dist-tag. Applies\nto both registries.","tree":{"sha":"a0c0996867372d073a37940a8e9d85f8005968be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/a0c0996867372d073a37940a8e9d85f8005968be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/cb7b43569ff5c8c865633428618fb17e73511663","verification":{"payload":"tree a0c0996867372d073a37940a8e9d85f8005968be\nparent 117e13384a40b29267d80ba0cef9f52cdf715800\nauthor Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo <futjesus@gmail.com> 1779896819 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779896819 -0400\n\n🔍 ci: fix npm OIDC ENEEDAUTH (+provenance) and always tag latest (#643)\n\n* 🔍 ci: diagnose npm OIDC ENEEDAUTH with --provenance and debug step\n\npublish-npm fails with ENEEDAUTH (npm 11.8.0, id-token: write set, no\ntoken). npm CLI issue #9088 notes trusted-publishing failures surface as\na misleading ENEEDAUTH. Add --provenance to force the OIDC/id-token path\n(explicit error if id-token is missing) and a safe debug step reporting\nwhether the OIDC request env vars are present (no secret values printed).\n\n* 🏷️ ci: always tag the published version as latest\n\nPublish with --tag latest (atomic at publish time) so the newest version\nis always the npm/GitHub Packages latest regardless of its prerelease tag,\nthen add the prerelease tag (e.g. alpha) as a secondary dist-tag. Applies\nto both registries.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFxHzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxLgQAAADIWcIFgMKmdjB13qyH54C\n3dMpwep2GPfKJVgcbqWRgbMsSX4nGf2NxZYzW8QenvTiB4SpTF+ZalMQcSxn/ynS\nEsMvp8q9bpmwqvzDcxhEFMErFBoavMJMCZJ2OMImQ0WtaEqKJW+PMayGd8p1al2k\n0nzHE7liz1rar/gijdEI8lOfi0GIcurDsO946JLHQ4bEWGAf+sOA8pLmAksahgSV\nUGMyLszw7xINRFjjm2Q9ywOd4lFFat+L2dlVK3r6fbjdUcaYDAUIv90Eaq+s8iGY\npbcAKay4rhvJAYAFe12NRS6RqGgY2Wi04Zyv7QApU2HTeKRVjGAVP3I2a3+awJlN\ni8XBstjeNctxC55xP4xXB9/9/f1iMcu8mFbIE7b/6EJQF7eSNJ/Ul/SXZcVhSxQJ\nUmS+hKk7Jndbc2DFaK1YPNoKQ00zjdrUYc+4u829R8Jun7UV1zkdnVH7w5ooJE6C\nSMHGCFLNBo615JLw5Jnkurrh34C4LLDCO+SpmOyfhaH+gSBIOo5VxUVKIBdcakXB\n6i+noYsXqc8RpKmyB8lJc9OLrgHR2HQA4YbgzOqHu2ZhLYtS+rrlPt6CxPEQYfj/\nt6oUlIBIvhE1VTb1FBelYHGMRusiJ9NKitYQr4nEPc3/FWXu+BVPB3zmImOWKlml\n7TnaqBS3+KCb8RTJIDEF\n=n96c\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-27T15:47:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.