esus","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2MzQyOTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/futjesus","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/commits/16f30c1f9393487f23becadf452f2556005b0aac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-27T15:29:30Z","email":"futjesus@gmail.com","name":"Jesús Manuel Fuentes Trejo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-27T15:29:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"👷 ci: migrate npm publish to OIDC trusted publishing (#642)\n\nSplit release-package.yml into three jobs so the npm publish can use the\nTrusted Publisher (OIDC) configured on npm:\n\n- bump-and-publish-github (self-hosted): build, version bump, GitHub\n  Packages publish; uploads dist as an artifact.\n- publish-npm (ubuntu-latest): adds id-token: write and publishes to\n  npmjs.org via OIDC (no NPM_TOKEN). Avoids setup-node registry-url so an\n  empty NODE_AUTH_TOKEN can''t disable OIDC; provenance is automatic.\n- notify-slack (self-hosted): runs only after both publishes succeed.\n\nnpm Trusted Publishing does not support self-hosted runners yet, which is\nwhy the npm publish is split onto a GitHub-hosted runner.","tree":{"sha":"112df25703bc42cf4220a595671b57795d554a74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/trees/112df25703bc42cf4220a595671b57795d554a74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konstructio/konstruct-ui/git/commits/16f30c1f9393487f23becadf452f2556005b0aac","verification":{"payload":"tree 112df25703bc42cf4220a595671b57795d554a74\nparent 562440f71f2189aedaa872f367cb74cbe6989a71\nauth